  "description": "*\"She neither died nor was she killed, and she grew up to be an adult.\"*\nFrom the age of 10 to 27, a record of the time she passed.\n\n27-10 is the story of \"her\" who lives with two cats, who, at first glance, looks normal but actually has scars from being exposed to domestic sexual violence as a child. After receiving psychological counseling for the first time at the age of 27, she calmly tells the story of her adolescence, the process of recovering from her wounds and overcoming them, her struggles with her sexuality, and finally, her story of achieving true independence.\n\n(Source: Wisdom House, translated)\n\n*Note: Won the Readers' Popularity Award at the 2020 Bucheon Manga Award.*",
